This layer provides recipes for integrating BKK API components into Yocto.

Dependencies
============

Required layers:

  URI: /data/projects/yocto/poky/meta
  branch: kirkstone

  URI: /data/projects/yocto/meta-openembedded/meta-oe
  branch: kirkstone

  URI: /data/projects/bkk_display/meta-BKK-api
  branch: local


Adding the layer
================

Run:

  bitbake-layers add-layer /data/projects/bkk_display/meta-BKK-api


Provided recipe
===============

`bkk-api`:
- Builds and installs the UDS server binary (`/usr/bin/bkk_uds_server`)
- Installs and enables `bkk-uds-server.service`
- Installs the UDS client shared object in package `bkk-api-client`
- Installs public UDS client headers in `bkk-api-dev`
- Installs the UDS test application in package `bkk-api-test`

`bkk-api-keyenv`:
- Installs the API key bootstrap service, helper script, and default key file under `/etc/bkk-api`
- Enables `bkk-api-keygen.service` to export the key into the runtime environment

Build example
=============

  bitbake bkk-api

